  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community concessions in the Mayan Biosphere Reserve</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asociacin de Comunidades Forestales de Petn (ACOFOP) will obtain the proper permits to sustainably harvest renewable resources from the Mayan Biosphere Reserve, develop a strategy to secure authorization to develop environmentally responsible economic activities in other protected areas and strengthen a network of community residents that will document how they benefit from these activities. Some 500 people will benefit directly and 7,800 indirectly from these grant activities</narrative>
  </description>
